message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Argus One: DOI-based duplicate merger for Zotero"
abstract: >-
  Argus One is a Zotero plugin that merges duplicate items by DOI only.
  It keeps the newest record's field values, unions tags, related items,
  and collection memberships across duplicates, re-parents attachments
  and notes, and trashes older copies inside a single transaction.
